# ---------------------------------------------------------------- artefacts
# Everything under output/ is regenerated by `python engine.py` +
# `python evaluate.py`. Small metric files are tracked as review evidence;
# the bulky, fully reproducible artefacts are not.
# `output*` covers output/, output_v2/ and any scratch run directory.
**/output*/**/*.pkl
**/output*/**/*.log
**/output*/**/model*.txt
**/output*/**/scores.csv
**/output*/plots/
**/output_smoke/
**/output_e2e/

